  --> ./tests/cases/arrays/err_arrays.aipl:36:10
   |
36 |         ["a", "b"] => 1,
   |          ^^^

error: non-exhaustive match on an array: add a `_` arm
  --> ./tests/cases/arrays/err_arrays.aipl:42:5
   |
42 |     match (xs) {
   |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^

error: the `_` arm must be last (arms after it are unreachable)
  --> ./tests/cases/arrays/err_arrays.aipl:51:9
   |
51 |         _ => 0,
   |         ^

